      "name": "[Blueprint] [Yidhari] Piercing Light - Lv.50",
      "desc": "This Blueprint can be used to unlock Yidhari's exclusive Tactical Prism crafting at the Smart Workshop. Obtained through investigations or purchased from Boojee's Store - Permanent Store - Blueprint Direct Sale.\nItem Effect: When the squad is affected by Corruption, the Max HP reduction is reduced to 10%.\nAfter Yidhari consumes Adrenaline to activate <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack</color>, she gains 4 stacks of <color=#FFFFFF>Frost Coil</color>. When a <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack</color> hits an enemy, consumes 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>Frost Coil</color> to attack the target. This effect can trigger no more than once every 1s.",
